cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SelectBench, please cite the paper below (NeurIPS 2026). To cite
  the software itself, use the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: "SelectBench: a selectivity benchmark for structure-based generative models"
abstract: >-
  SelectBench evaluates whether molecules produced by structure-based
  generative models bind selectively to their intended target rather than to
  related off-targets. It provides docking-based selectivity metrics across
  three benchmark suites: hand-curated case studies, a safety anti-target
  panel, and oriented CrossDocked pairs.
authors:
